  unitName: Supreme Dragon Elderex
  unitId: 50106
  unitNumber: 1300
  description: Over time incomprehensible to this world, Duelmex became a dragon
    god. The presence of Elderex demands respect even among the gods. According to
    legend, Elderex possesses the power to split seas and sunder continents, but
    has never become involved in the wars of humans, or gods. It is foretold that
    if Elderex ever goes to war, the fate of this world will be sealed. However,
    no historical record exists to substantiate these legends, and some doubt the
    very existence of the Supreme Dragon.
  summonDesc: This war between humans and gods is but a speck upon the seas of infinity.
    And yet you say you would kill, and die, for this cause?
  fusionDesc: All others are a part of myself, you say...? Most fascinating. Rather
    like the fate of all living things to move through the circle of life.
  evoDesc: Human child...you say you require my power? I warn you, this will require
    more discipline than all of your kind will ever know.
  element: 5
  rarity: 6
